&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Platform Engineering Manager will lead architecture, cloud strategy, and network services across Inizio&#39;s corporate IT estate. You will set technical direction, governs standards, and lead senior engineers and architects designing solutions for the wider Platform Engineering organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead Design Engineering &amp;amp; Cloud Enablement and ensure Inizio&#39;s enterprise architecture remains consistent, scalable, secure, and supportable. You will translate technology strategy into practical engineering direction and develop a team operating as a true Centre for Enablement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Architecture Governance&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set engineering standards, architectural direction, and quality expectations across Inizio&#39;s enterprise platform estate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee architecture governance, ensuring you approve, and document solution designs through the appropriate processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain reference architectures, technology standards, and Architecture Decision Records across cloud, network, identity, observability, and integration domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess the latest technologies and vendor capabilities, providing clear recommendations for Inizio&#39;s environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed security, resilience, supportability, and cost effectiveness into all architecture and engineering outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Cloud Enablement &amp;amp; C4E Leadership&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Inizio&#39;s Centre for Enablement model, delivering reusable patterns, landing zones, golden paths, and engineering guardrails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the cloud enablement strategy, driving Azure and AWS adoption following standards, security requirements, and the IT roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee cloud engineering delivery across Infrastructure as Code, CI/CD, automation, and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide leadership across the cloud and platform toolchain, including Azure, AWS, Entra ID, Boomi, ServiceNow integrations, and related controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage cloud vendor and managed service partner relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;People Management &amp;amp; Development&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage senior engineers and architects through regular 1:1s, goals, performance reviews, and development conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and sustain a collaborative team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify skills gaps and develop plans to address them through recruitment, training, or professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
